1
00:00:00,715 --> 00:00:03,115
(Sheldon:)you can have your helium
and we'll be on our way.

2
00:00:03,118 --> 00:00:04,988
(Man:)Yeah, well, is there
something wrong with it?

3
00:00:04,986 --> 00:00:07,386
(Leonard:)No, nothing.
We just changed our mind.

4
00:00:07,389 --> 00:00:09,359
(Sheldon:)He has glasses and
I'm a know-it-all;

5
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:11,827
(Sheldon:)we are not built
for prison.

6
00:00:11,826 --> 00:00:13,356
(Man:)Yeah, I hear you.

7
00:00:13,361 --> 00:00:15,161
(Man:)Well, you're good guys,
so I'll, uh...

8
00:00:15,163 --> 00:00:16,893
(Man:)I'll take the helium
off your hands.

9
00:00:16,898 --> 00:00:17,898
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

10
00:00:17,899 --> 00:00:20,169
(Man:)But you ain't getting
your money back.

11
00:00:20,168 --> 00:00:23,438
(Sheldon:)You're taking advantage of us?

12
00:00:23,438 --> 00:00:26,778
(Sheldon:)We clarified nomenclature
together.

13
00:00:26,775 --> 00:00:29,175
(Man:)Look, I enjoy
semantic digressions

14
00:00:29,177 --> 00:00:32,977
(Man:)as much as the next guy,
but, uh, this is business.

15
00:00:32,981 --> 00:00:34,881
(Leonard:)You know what?

16
00:00:34,883 --> 00:00:36,113
(Leonard:)It's fine.
Keep the money.

17
00:00:36,117 --> 00:00:38,047
(Leonard:)We just want to be
done with this.

18
00:00:38,052 --> 00:00:40,082
(Man:)No problem, but I am
gonna have to charge you

19
00:00:40,088 --> 00:00:42,918
(Man:)a small helium restocking fee.

20
00:00:42,924 --> 00:00:44,454
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.

21
00:00:44,459 --> 00:00:45,659
(Leonard:)He wants more money.

22
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:48,490
(Sheldon:)Well, it better not be more than
a thousand dollars;

23
00:00:48,496 --> 00:00:50,196
(Sheldon:)that's all I've got on me.

24
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:55,503
(Man:)That's exactly how much it is.

25
00:00:55,503 --> 00:00:56,903
(Sheldon:)Finally,

26
00:00:56,905 --> 00:01:02,025
(Sheldon:)something breaks our way.

